  "id": "creamy-lemon-chicken-pasta",
  "name": "Creamy Lemon Chicken Pasta",
  "subtitle": "Baked farfalle with lemon cream sauce",
  "description": "Seasoned chicken and bow-tie pasta are combined with a creamy lemon sauce, topped with Parmesan, and baked until lightly browned.",
